  "description": "Elementary school teacher Gi-Jeong Go has lost almost everything: her parents when she was a child, her freedom when she had to support her shut-in younger brother, and now her very dignity as the class bully among her students and his mother threaten to turn her life into a living hell. Upon meeting the mild-mannered yet inscrutable lawyer In-Seop Oh, Gi-Jeong begins to find her life changing, though little does she know that wherever In-Seop goes, death follows…\n\n(Source: WEBTOON) \n\n*Note: Includes three side stories.*",
